  <item>
    <title>03｜亲密关系的尽头是友谊，吗？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/674af8ca0ed328720a758ef1</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">674af8ca0ed328720a758ef1</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 30 Nov 2024 11:58:44 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span>本期内容</span></strong><span>：</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>上一期跟大家聊要学会独处，拥抱孤独，但如何看待与处理亲密关系也同样重要。</span></p><span></span><p><span>亲密关系不只有爱情，还有亲情与友情，你会给它们排序吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span>其实不论是哪一种关系，都会有开始、冲突、结束。但友情相较亲情，需要自己选择与培育。相较爱情，它又更为坚固与灵活。</span></p><span></span><p><span>正如汪民安有本书叫《亲密关系的核心是友谊》，于我而言亲密关系的尽头也是，友情就这样钻入每一种关系之中，于是充满我们生命的无数瞬间。所以不要忽视友情，去交新的朋友，去拥抱I’ll be there for you的老友。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>那么，友情有终点与真理吗？是时候一起来谈谈了：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="178">02:58</a> 你是否经常交新朋友？为什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="414">06:54</a> 交友的底层需求是——</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="874">14:34</a> 你会给朋友分组吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1152">19:12</a> 那些年走散的阶段式陪伴</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1413">23:33</a> 做自己才能交到真的朋友</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1810">30:10</a> 友情vs爱情vs亲情 start！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2450">40:50</a> 你是否相信soulmate&amp;“只有心灵相通的挚友才能懂我天马行空的想法的意义”？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2760">46:00</a> “小团体”还是“1V1”？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3073">51:13</a> 希望我们都能，且敢“好好分手”</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>「</span><strong><span>主播</span></strong><span>」</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>Siko：一个学文学的，总在凌晨两点胡思乱想。</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>「</span><strong><span>嘉宾</span></strong><span>」</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>师姐：文学博士在读，旋转捧场王，超绝enfp，双鱼座守护者，半吊子塔罗爱好者，业余单口相声艺术家，少女。</span></p><span></span><p><span>刺猬：依旧不知道怎么自我介绍。但！目前最大愿望是有书读且能学会贝斯，老天保佑！！</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span>推歌time：</span></strong></li><span></span></ul><span></span><h3><em><span>Grateful Days</span></em><span> -- Dragon Ash</span></h3><span></span><h3><em><span>meta angel </span></em><span>-- FKA twigs（师姐推荐）</span></h3><span></span><h3><span>朋友 -- 缺省（刺猬推荐）</span></h3><span></span><h3><em><span>After hanabi -listen to my beats- </span></em><span>-- Nujabes</span></h3><span></span><p><em><strong><span>总之，请享受今天的助眠，祝听友们，也是朋友们收听愉快，每一刻都愉快。</span></strong></em></p>]]></description>
